## Java oracle provenance

The external Java checkout currently points at
`2238256de1d227a4384ba969dfa31473187b4d08` (RocketMQ 5.3.3), not 5.5.1. Its
pre-existing untracked file `broker/src/test/java/org/apache/rocketmq/broker/aaaa.java`
was not modified. Phase 18 source review and invoked fixtures use pinned Java
5.5.1 commit `efa1be59d6fc747ad220f036c86030f05f0419f9` and pinned 5.5.1 Maven
artifacts; provenance identities remain in
`docs/compatibility/PHASE_18_JAVA_PROVENANCE.md`.

## Environment limit and remaining acceptance work

The pinned Rust 1.85 MSVC target was installed and the cross-check retried, but
the environment lacks Windows SDK headers (`stdlib.h`, `windows.h`). Native
Windows runtime execution and current-revision remote Ubuntu CI remain open.
P18-V01 broad source/API/settings/input/error/control-flow and Rust reverse-
export reconciliation remains PARTIAL. Thirty of the 37 manifest scenarios
are live handoff cases marked `PENDING_PHASE_19`; Phase 19 Broker/Docker evidence
is still outstanding. This local gate refresh does not close Phase 18.

